('demo-summary-history-01', '#general', 'James and Sophia are arguing about percentages. James thinks equal percentage decreases and increases cancel out. Alice wants someone to check the calculation.', 24, TIMESTAMP '2026-06-15 09:15:00'),
('demo-summary-history-02', '#code', 'James sees changes to a second Python variable after mutating a list. Daniel suspects both names reference the same list. Olivia is tracing a loop over an array.', 20, TIMESTAMP '2026-06-15 09:12:00');
